  "description": "World v2 step 3 (plan g-svet-kulate-brehy): marching-squares transition sets, 16 tiles per pair of grounds. Tile index = corner bits (1 = inner ground): bit 0 top corner, bit 1 right, bit 2 bottom, bit 3 left. The renderer picks the tile from the four corners of a cell instead of blending along the diamond edges, so shores read as round curves. Preview: a pond of the inner ground.",
